<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tracor cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tracor cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near- and long-term ratings on Tracor Inc.</p>
<p>-- Cut near-term rating to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Cut long-term rating to accumulate from buy.</p>
</text>
